WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:06.480
Previously on 
The Reflection

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.350
So you weren't kidnapping 
these people to kill them.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.730
You hide in the mansion.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.480
I told you, I won't run away.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:28.120
Vy...

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.380
That's...

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.390
Don't, Vy!

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:35.590
No!

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.310
Wait! Vy!

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.360
Please let them all out into this world.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.340
I...

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.540
Answer me!

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.060
Michelle!

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.110
No...

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.630
It was my fault.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:23.270
I never should have gathered 
them all in one place.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:28.040
If I'd stayed behind...

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:31.560
If you'd stayed behind, 
you wouldn't be here now.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:36.340
They're indiscriminately 
kidnapping Reflected.

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:40.900
But that doesn't mean there's 
no way to stop them.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:43.140
Am I wrong?

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:52.100
I'm hungry. I'm going to go eat something.

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:08.100
How many people are connected 
to the name "Allen"?

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:27.160
Our school trip is coming up soon.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.100
So annoying. I wish it were in this country.

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.300
Same. I can't do airplanes.

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:32.330
Are you ready for it?

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:33.900
It's still early.

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.200
Yeah. What're you bringing?

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.630
No idea... Like, a toothbrush?

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:39.700
Won't they have them there?

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.600
I'm not sure...

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:44.610
Hey, are we even allowed to go?

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.420
I thought maybe the people hit by

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:58.940
the Reflection weren't necessarily in 
their places of residence when it hit.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:01.090
They might have met somewhere else.

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.730
After omitting some unneeded information,

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.740
I found the Allen family's roots...

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:09.620
Or rather, I found where the most 
members of the Allen family live.

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:14.080
Statistically, there should 
be more Reflected there.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:17.900
There weren't many hit by the 
Reflection here, but it's not zero.

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:22.750
I added in other variables and 
got a number of candidates.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.390
That's quite a few.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.190
It's not too far from here, either.

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:29.680
I'm sure they have their eye on it, too.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.780
Will you be able to save them?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.930
I will!

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.190
We're with you, too.

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:50.200
What?

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.190
Where are we going?

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:54.710
San Antonio.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.800
San Antonio 
Texas

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.860
It's said that there's a river monster

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:43.320
named "Tony" living at the bottom of this river.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:48.660
Every year, when we search the riverbed, 
we find things like phones and cameras

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.830
that visitors have dropped.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:57.280
If you don't pay attention, Tony might 
drag you into the river, too!

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:04.830
Well, just between you and 
me, it's an urban legend.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:08.840
Just a rumor people started to spread,

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:14.690
to make sure y'all don't go 
losing your things in the river.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:23.580
Mom... Is that Tony?

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:24.630
What?

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.150
Miss Allen?

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:39.500
I already knew that.

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:58.350
Shall we swing?

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:11.610
Vy, over here!

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:24.240
Too late.

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:09.050
Uh, what? Hey, wait...

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.970
H-Hey, wait...

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.830
H-Hey... Wait, hey!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:31.890
I won't let them take anyone else!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:09.660
N-No...

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.090
Could you guys get out of the way?

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.040
Whoops...

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:43.760
I was supposed to fight you in New York,

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.530
so I welcome this fight.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:48.660
But I have other orders.

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:54.520
My bad.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.680
Big Wheel is on TV!

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.330
Big Wheel?

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:35.380
That's the name of my wheelchair.

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:40.200
<i>Several cases involving Reflected 
have been reported,</i>

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:44.620
<i>but we haven't seen one this bold, or 
involving so many simultaneous incidents,</i>

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:49.060
<i>since the New York Times Square 
Reflected terror incident.</i>

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.400
<i>Not to mention in broad daylight.</i>

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:53.370
<i>According to eyewitnesses,</i>

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:56.370
<i>several women were also kidnapped.</i>

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:00.790
They're using "Reflected" so casually now.

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:04.880
I wonder if everywhere is going 
to end up like New Orleans...

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.850
I didn't have time to worry 
about who was watching.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.200
Are there any more Allens?

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.570
None that fit all the criteria.

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:17.840
And it's not as if we can just take 
all of them away somewhere.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:22.260
But if we can secure at least one, 
we'll be able to move forward.

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:25.110
If we can find out why they want all of them,

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:29.350
we should be able to figure out 
where this is all leading.

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:31.540
But what can we do?

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:45.760
Jim? It's me.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.960
Could you come by?

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.270
Yeah, thanks.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:52.820
Jim?

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:01.150
Hey, sorry about this.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.520
It's fine.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.600
Password.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:14.330
Hey! Who said you could—

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:15.210
Aren't you in a hurry?

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:24.260
WTHX-On.

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:37.020
Nina Fisher. A woman in her forties. 
Works at a suburban barber shop.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:41.030
Fisher? But we're looking 
for people named Allen—

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:45.310
People do get married. It's not strange 
that her last name would've changed.

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:56.840
This place looks dangerous.

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:57.690
Hey—

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.560
Are you Nina Fisher?

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:15.340
Nina?

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.360
Um, Nina...

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:21.370
I ain't Nina!

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:22.120
Huh?

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:26.340
You old hag! What do you think you're doing?!

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:30.160
Say that name one more time, 
and I'll cut your bangs off!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.780
Um, do we have the wrong person?

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:35.790
I'm Margaret. Call me "Maggie."

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:38.540
Maggie... Um, where's Nina—

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:40.840
You said that damn name again!

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.290
Calm down.

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:45.750
Lady, could you possibly put 
down the scissors and call Ni...

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.420
I mean, her here?

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:51.550
Why should I have to go all the way to LA?!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.190
So you're saying she's not here?

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:56.310
She ain't been here for twenty years.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:59.440
Is she, by chance, your daughter?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:00.460
Hmph.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.070
We've got the wrong place. Let's head to LA.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:07.300
Who do you think you are, 
bossing us around like this?

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:10.570
I'm Jim. I'm a detective in San Antonio.

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:13.050
First Debra and now Jim...

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:16.070
What the heck? Are you trying 
to say I'm useless?

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:18.230
Hey! Stop arguing over there!

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:19.910
We're the ones arguing!

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:22.840
If you guys hadn't distracted her—

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.840
Yeah, yeah.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.550
I'll fix it.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:31.350
Lady, if you happen to know her LA address...

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:35.230
Maggie, your daughter's in danger.

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:37.510
We want to protect her.

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.050
What are you talking about?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:40.940
How would I know?

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:45.020
She left twenty years ago, saying she didn't
want to be stuck in this podunk town,

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:48.410
and she was gonna start a 
fancy salon in the city.

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:51.250
I haven't heard from her in twenty years since.

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:55.110
After twenty years, even your own 
daughter becomes a stranger.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.640
She's a Reflected, just like us.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:11.010
What the hell do you think you're doing?!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.740
You can go to hell!

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.990
Hey, what about me?

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:15.130
I'm staying right here in Texas!

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:17.830
Please, just stay with us.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.580
You're in danger, too!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.100
That's my daughter.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.100
You just called her your daughter, huh?

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:27.050
Let's go save your daughter together.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.410
Is she in that much trouble?

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:32.430
I'd say <i>that's</i> the one who's in trouble.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.290
Right?

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.440
You've got some nerve, stealing my target.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:48.120
Don't think you'll get away with it.

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:51.340
Stop talking, and do what you're supposed to.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:52.590
Yeah, yeah.

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:16.030
We have no business with you.

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:18.960
Hand over Margaret Fisher.

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:23.740
Didn't you hear me?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.310
Decoys?

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:35.880
Vy!

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:45.300
Just buy as much time as possible.

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:50.030
Right? Wasn't this a great plan?

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:57.980
Jeez, what's with this filthy car?

00:16:57.980 --> 00:17:00.590
It smells, and it's making my head hurt.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:02.170
I'm gonna be sick.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.000
I've gotta deal with this until we get to LA?

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.750
I'll let Jim know.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:10.080
By the way, will those guys be 
effective sacrificial pawns?

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.360
Don't call them that.

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:14.150
I'm sure they're keeping them busy for us.

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:17.820
Honestly, I don't want to 
see my daughter now.

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:20.010
Even if you raise them on your own,

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:24.020
your kids will betray you 
and go off somewhere.

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:28.390
I'm sure that sounds familiar 
to you kids, too.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.190
I text my dad now and then.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.610
You do?

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.120
And you, Eleanor? Did you come 
without telling them?

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:39.650
I was told that it's important to think for 
yourself and make your own decisions.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:42.630
Hey, don't look at me.

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:45.700
What are y'all yappin' about?

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:51.930
Kids can't talk like real adults 
until an adult says they can.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:57.420
What good does it do ya to act like 
an adult when you aren't one yet?

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:27.070
I am Wraith.

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:31.530
You are the only one who can see me.

00:18:32.510 --> 00:18:35.380
The others haven't noticed yet.

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:37.950
Stay as you are.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:40.740
Why? How did you...

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:42.730
I want to talk to you.

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.210
Talk?

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:46.820
I acknowledge your power.

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:48.010
My power?

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:51.020
The Reflected will become one.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:54.370
We will make this world our own.

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:57.610
That is what Darkness desires.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.670
Darkness?

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:01.280
What are you talking about?

00:19:01.690 --> 00:19:06.040
And for that to happen, we need you, as well.

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:08.310
I...

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:11.430
We don't want to become enemies of humanity.

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:14.660
We don't want to make the world ours, either!

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:17.550
We all have to make our own decisions.

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:20.050
Darkness will decide that for you.

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.210
Stop!

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:24.820
Hey, are you listening?

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:26.790
Why are you spacing out?

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:47.040
Los Angeles 
California

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:10.970
Hey, we're closed now.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:14.770
Mom...

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:20.520
What? You came all the way 
to LA to laugh at me?

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:25.030
This looks a lot like my shop.

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:28.460
It's completely different!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.290
You had to come out all the way out here...

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.060
This is how I ended up! I can't help it!

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:36.830
It took me twenty years 
to finally understand.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:39.150
So you decided for yourself

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.290
that this was the shop you wanted?

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:46.670
Well, I was alone for so long.

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:48.690
Then you've finally become an adult.

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:22.410
This looks really bad...

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:25.290
Again?

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.070
There, there.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.900
They're saying that our reunion

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:49.250
after twenty years might actually be goodbye.

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:50.230
Huh?

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:57.840
I won't let you have my daughter!

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:01.090
How did you know we'd be here?

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:04.980
There is nothing our master doesn't know.

00:22:05.930 --> 00:22:08.530
I'd like to make a deal. It's rather simple.

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:13.170
If you hand over the mother and 
daughter, you will go unharmed.

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:14.550
Not happening!

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:18.820
They are the last two. 
I cannot back down, either.

00:22:19.090 --> 00:22:21.340
Do you want to make this 
messier than necessary?

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:26.070
Just like New York and San Antonio? Here in LA?

00:22:27.090 --> 00:22:29.060
It'll cause a huge commotion.

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:34.290
Don't underestimate a woman from Texas!

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:35.530
Well said!

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:46.440
It seems the deal has fallen through.

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:10.950
It's showtime!

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Next Time 
Team I-Guy

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Narration: Stan Lee
